{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lTFfH1zWTt1794352802.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>輝達持有股權的新型雲端企業CoreWeave第三季度業績好過市場預期，股價在延長交易時段曾升近一成一。</p><p></p><p>公司季內蝕7.09億元，按年擴大5.4倍。每股攤薄虧損1.27美元，按年多蝕近4.8倍。收入36.61億美元，較預期多超過1億美元。截至9月底止，待確認合約收入為1,325億美元，較第二季末多兩成七。</p><p></p><p>公司上調全年度經調整經營盈利預測，以中位數計，較之前預測高兩成六。收入預測亦上調至130億至133億美元。資本開支預測下限則由原本的350億美元，上調至370億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:08:58.207923+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T23:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T02:00:40.782837+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T00:02:25.608234+00:00","content_hash":"0282a7da7a082e703f0c2faf84728c48cdf0c2c416fc8ec6f913b9c16ec735f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:08:58.207923+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}